  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A cherry pitting machine pits <math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math> pounds of cherries in <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math> minutes. At this rate, how many minutes does it take the machine to pit <math alttext=\"96\"><mn>96</mn>\n</math> pounds of cherries?</p>",
